  "question": {
    "text": "If the line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math> is a common tangent to the hyperbola&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>64</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and the circle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then which one of the following is true?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "SARwN",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>369</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "CAJWo",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "qcToY",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>369</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "EzJiY",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
